"{\n \"homeReviews\": \"Reviews\\n★★★★★\\n5.0 out of 5 stars\\nVIEW ALL REVIEWS\\nEXPLORE\\nFinancing\\nAPPLY NOW\\nLEARN\\nAbout Us\\nLEARN MORE\\nGET IN\\nTouch\\nCONTACT US\\nEXCEPTIONAL INVENTORY\\nSelection\\nHIGHLY RELIABLE\\nReputation\\nSMOOTH DEAL\\nProcess\\nSTRONG CUSTOMER\\nService\\nSelection\\nOur dealership takes pride in curating an exceptional vehicle inventory compilation. Each vehicle in our inventory has been carefully selected to offer a diverse and high-quality selection to our customers. We go above and beyond to source vehicles that meet our rigorous standards of excellence in terms of condition, performance, and features. We enjoy having a variety of types of vehicles including exotics, classics, American modern muscle, Japanese supercars and much more.\\nSELL YOUR VEHICLE\\nGet Top Dollar for Your Car\\nWe Make Selling Simple\\nLooking to sell your vehicle? Geneva Motor Haus offers competitive prices and a hassle-free selling experience. Our expert team will provide you with a fair, no-obligation appraisal. Whether you're selling a luxury vehicle, exotic car, or daily driver, we're interested in purchasing quality automobiles.\\nSELL YOUR CAR\\nREVIEWS\\nOur happy customers\\n‹\\n★★★★★\\nHello friends, I bought a car entirely online from Geneva Motor Haus and I could not be happier with the way it went. I don’t just mean I’m happy with the car, I mean from start to finish, Shane the owner, was amenable at every corner. He was at my beck and call for every need, and there were a lot, considering I was purchasing this car without actually having seen it with my own eyes. The Geneva Motor Haus’ 5 Star rating on Google gave me the confidence I needed to trust that Shane was being transparent with all the information I required. Shane and I messaged for a week, like old college friends who just got in touch again. Extra pictures, a walk around video, shoot I think he would have gladly given me a virtual video chat ride in the car if I’d asked. Whatever you need this man is there for it! They even shipped my car with a same day carrier. It arrived in beautiful shape. Even tho I had purchased a one owner, low miles,13 year old vehicle they made it look and feel brand new for me. After talking all week, I believe Shane puts a lot of thought into the cars he is willing to sell and it shows. I do not regret putting my trust in this small business and I am now proud to add to it’s 5 Star rating. Put your mind at ease and shop Geneva Motor Haus.\\nD\\nDefries\\n★★★★★\\nCalling Shane was the best phone call I made throughout my car search! I had been looking for this particular car for awhile and was absolutely exhausted with dealerships! The photos would look good but once I arrived at a dealership, I was very disappointed. Not with Geneva Motor Haus! This car was even better than the photos! I was looking at some of the other cars Shane had and I was very impressed! Shane was very professional and easy to talk with. Despite it being Memorial day weekend, Shane worked very hard with everything including the financing to get us this car! I will definitely be calling Shane for our next vehicle!! Whatever vehicle you're looking for, I would highly recommend buying from Geneva Motor Haus because they are honest and great to work with! It's how the car buying experience should be...ask for Shane!\\nK\\nKIETH\\n★★★★★\\nTypically, shopping for a car is stressful. There are so many unknowns to take into consideration. To the average buyer, it can be quite overwhelming. After countless hours of searching, I discovered a dealer in the Burlington area. I browsed the inventory and inquired about a vehicle I was interested in. Within 24 hours, I received a text from a man named Shane. He let me know the vehicle was still available and we set up a test drive for the same day. In the end, I decided to make the purchase. Not only is the car in great condition, but Shane is a great person that genuinely cares. He didn't see me as \\\"just another sale.\\\" He didn't pressure me to buy anything. He has very nice vehicles and he stands behind them. You owe it to yourself to check this place out. His inventory caters to many different budgets. Reach out to Shane the next time you need a high quality vehicle. You won't regret it.\\nP\\nPATRICK\\n★★★★★\\nI recently sold my 2014 bmw i8 to GENEVA MOTOR HAUS and was very happy with the offer Shane give me for it. He was very helpful though the whole process. They send an inspector out to my house to inspect the car and send me an offer the same day. Their offer is very fair and I don't feel insult like other dealer who try to low ball me. On the day of I drove the car for one more last time to swap motor after doing all paper work they cut me and check and even call an Uber for me to get back home. I am definitely looking forward to doing more business with them and I highly recommend them to any of my friend.\\nD\\nDuc Trinh\\n★★★★★\\nShane was great to work with when selling our 2001 Porsche Carrera 4. Extremely easy process, and he made sure all questions were answered. The price was fair and the communication throughout the transaction was exceptional. I highly recommend giving him a shout.\\nM\\nMitch Babe\\n★★★★★\\nSold my '23 Nissan Z to Shane. Overall a very good experience and made a very good offer on it. If I were to sell another vehicle, I'll do business with him again. Process is very straightforward and seamless, for a person who does not have a lot of knowledge doing a 'private' sale, he provided all the information and answered all my questions.\\nI\\nIvan Martin Dimaculangan\\n★★★★★\\nI recently sold my Honda CR-V and the transaction was great. Shane was professional, offered a fair price, and handled all the paperwork. Highly recommended!\\nJ\\nJeff Haneline\\n★★★★★\\nDealing with Rushang / Shane was a breath of fresh air after all the time wasters who contact you online. He was courteous, professional and completely fair. The whole process of selling my car to him was a breeze and I couldn’t be happier. Thank you!\\nC\\nColin\\n★★★★★\\nI just had the most pleasant car buying experience I've ever had! And I've bought a good amount of cars in my lifetime. Shane was a person anyone would enjoy doing business with. He was very informative and answered many of my questions before I even asked them. He was personable and very professional. Bravo\\nJ\\nJILL BURCH\\n★★★★★\\nWe found a beautiful 2006 Grand Prix GXP with super low miles on marketplace. Sent a quick message and received a response as if he was waiting by his phone for a mesage! He was very accommodating with sending pictures and videos of the car before we came to see it! We had to travel 4 hours from Michigan to see it and test drive it. After we agreed to purchase the car, the paperwork was handled smoothly and quickly. I’d absolutely recommend shopping here for your next vehicle!\\nC\\nCORY\\n★★★★★\\nShane was very professional and responsive since the beginning . From getting pictures from every angle to getting inspections I requested done, he’d help with no hesitation . I got one of my dream cars with him , glad I found him . Thank you Geneva motor haus, I will be recommend my friends to you all .\\nD\\nDiego Castro\\n★★★★★\\nShane is an all around car expert but he really shines as a Porsche expert. Bought a 2005 Porsche 997.1 from Shane sight unseen from out of state and it was absolutely mint. I feel as if Shane and I are actually friends now due to his nature and transparency during the entire process. Even after the sale Shane has been excellent to answer any questions. I hope to be able to purchase another Porsche from him in the future when I give this one to my son someday.\\nC\\nCHARLES\\n›\\nVIEW ALL REVIEWS\\nSIGN UP FOR\\nOur Newsletters\\nGET THE LATEST UPDATES\\nSIGN UP\\nGET IN TOUCH\\nContact / Location\\nGeneva Motor Haus\\n600 Faust RD\\nUNIT 8\\nBurlington Wi, 53105\\nShowroom: (262)-249-6777\\nSend Us A Message\\nMonday - Friday:\\n10AM-4PM\\nSaturday:\\nAppt Only\\nSunday:\\nClosed\\nGET DIRECTIONS\",\n \"about\": \"ABOUT US\\nGeneva Motor Haus\\nWhere Passion Meets Perfection\\nOUR MISSION\\nExcellence in Every Detail\\nAt Geneva Motor Haus, we are dedicated to delivering an automotive experience unlike any other. Our mission goes far beyond simply selling vehicles—we exist to connect discerning clients with the world’s most exceptional luxury, performance, and exotic automobiles through a personalized, transparent, and high-touch process. We believe that purchasing a vehicle should be an exciting and memorable journey, crafted with care, attention to detail, and a genuine passion for the art of motoring.\\nWith years of specialized expertise in the high-end automotive market, we carefully curate a collection of the finest pre-owned vehicles available. Each vehicle in our inventory is hand-selected for its quality, provenance, and condition, and is meticulously inspected, detailed, and maintained to meet the highest standards of excellence. From rare collector cars to modern performance icons, every offering reflects the level of craftsmanship and performance our clients expect.\\nOur commitment to excellence extends well beyond the showroom. We take pride in building long-term relationships founded on trust, integrity, and an unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction. Whether you are searching for your next dream car, expanding a collection, or seeking guidance from industry professionals, our team is here to provide expert support at every stage.\\nOUR VALUES\\nWhat Drives Us\\n✓\\nExcellence\\nWe maintain the highest standards in every vehicle we offer and every interaction we have.\\n✓\\nIntegrity\\nTransparency and honesty are at the core of everything we do. No hidden fees, no surprises.\\n✓\\nPassion\\nOur love for luxury vehicles drives us to provide an exceptional experience for every customer.\\n✓\\nService\\nWe go above and beyond to ensure complete customer satisfaction before, during, and after the sale.\\nOUR STORY\\nBuilt on Excellence\\nGeneva Motor Haus was founded with a simple yet powerful vision: to create a destination where automotive enthusiasts and luxury vehicle seekers could find exceptional vehicles matched with unparalleled service. What started as a passion project has grown into one of the region's most trusted luxury automotive dealerships.\\nOver the years, we have built a reputation for excellence by carefully selecting each vehicle in our inventory, maintaining rigorous quality standards, and treating every customer relationship as a long-term partnership. Our automotive experts bring decades of combined experience, ensuring that whether you're looking for a daily driver or a collector's dream, you'll find exactly what you're seeking.\\n12+\\nYEARS EXPERIENCE\\n5000+\\nVEHICLES SOLD\\n98%\\nCUSTOMER SATISFACTION\\nWHY CHOOSE US\\nThe Geneva Motor Haus Difference\\nCurated Selection\\nEvery vehicle in our inventory is hand-selected and thoroughly inspected to ensure it meets our exacting standards of quality and condition.\\nTransparent Process\\nComplete vehicle history reports, no hidden fees, and honest pricing. We believe in complete transparency throughout the entire process.\\nExpert Knowledge\\nOur knowledgeable staff brings decades of combined experience to help you find the perfect vehicle and navigate every step of the process.\\nConvenient Location\\nLocated in Burlington, Wisconsin, we're easily accessible and offer a comfortable showroom experience for browsing our exceptional inventory.\\nReady to Experience Excellence?\\nVisit our showroom or browse our inventory online. We're ready to help you find the perfect luxury vehicle.\\nBROWSE INVENTORY\\nCONTACT US\",\n \"sell\": \"SELL YOUR CAR\\nSell Your Vehicle\\nGet the Best Value\\nWHY SELL TO US\\nThe Geneva Motor Haus Advantage\\nSelling your vehicle should be easy and profitable. At Geneva Motor Haus, we've streamlined the process to ensure you get the best value for your car with minimal effort on your part.\\n✓\\nFair Market Value\\nWe offer competitive prices based on current market values and vehicle condition.\\n✓\\nQuick Process\\nGet an appraisal in minutes and complete the sale in as little as one day.\\n✓\\nNo Hassle\\nWe handle all paperwork and make the selling process smooth and stress-free.\\n✓\\nAll Vehicle Types\\nWe buy luxury vehicles, exotics, classics, and daily drivers of all makes and models.\\nHOW IT WORKS\\nSimple 4-Step Process\\nOur streamlined process makes selling your vehicle quick and hassle-free. From initial contact to final payment, we guide you through every step.\\n01\\nSubmit Your Vehicle Info\\nFill out our simple form with your vehicle details and contact information.\\n02\\nGet Your Appraisal\\nOur team will review your information and contact you with a fair market value offer.\\n03\\nSchedule Inspection\\nWe'll arrange a convenient time to inspect your vehicle in person or via photos.\\n04\\nComplete the Sale\\nOnce agreed, we handle all paperwork and payment, and you drive away satisfied.\\nGET STARTED\\nSell Us Your Car\\nFill out the form below with your vehicle information and contact details. Our team will review your submission and contact you within 24 hours with a competitive offer.\\nFirst and Last Name *\\nYear Make Model *\\nHow many miles *\\nVIN Number\\nTitle Status\\nSelect Title Status\\nClean\\nSalvage\\nRebuilt\\nOther\\nDesired Price\\nVehicle Info\\nPhone *\\nEmail *\\nSUBMIT FOR APPRAISALCLEAR FORM\\nBy submitting this form, you agree to be contacted by Geneva Motor Haus regarding your vehicle. We respect your privacy and will never share your information with third parties.\\nReady to Sell Your Vehicle?\\nGet in touch with us today for a free, no-obligation appraisal. We're here to make selling your car as easy as possible.\\nCALL (262)-249-6777\\nCONTACT US\",\n \"financing\": \"FINANCING\\nGet Approved Today\\nFlexible Financing Solutions for Your Dream Vehicle\\nWHY CHOOSE US\\nFinancing Made Simple\\nAt Geneva Motor Haus, we make financing your luxury vehicle as smooth as possible. Our experienced finance team works with trusted lenders to provide competitive rates and flexible terms tailored to your needs.\\n✓\\nCompetitive Rates\\nWe work with multiple lenders to secure the best financing rates available for your situation.\\n✓\\nFast Approval\\nGet pre-approved in minutes with our streamlined application process and quick decision-making.\\n✓\\nFlexible Terms\\nChoose from a variety of loan terms and payment options that fit your budget and lifestyle.\\n✓\\nBad Credit OK\\nWe understand that credit situations vary. We work with all credit types to find solutions.\\nOUR FINANCING OPTIONS\\nFind the Right Solution for You\\nNew Vehicle Financing\\nSpecial rates and terms available for new luxury vehicles in our inventory.\\nPre-Owned Financing\\nCompetitive financing options for our extensive selection of pre-owned luxury vehicles.\\nLease Options\\nFlexible lease programs that allow you to drive your dream car with lower monthly payments.\\nRefinancing\\nLower your monthly payments or interest rate by refinancing your existing auto loan.\\nAPPLY NOW\\nFinancing Application\\nFill out the form below to get started with your financing application. Our finance team will review your application and contact you within 24 hours to discuss your options.\\nPersonal Information\\nFirst Name *\\nLast Name *\\nEmail *\\nPhone *\\nAddress *\\nCity *\\nState *\\nZip Code *\\nFinancial Information\\nEmployment Status *\\nSelect Employment Status\\nEmployed\\nSelf-Employed\\nUnemployed\\nRetired\\nStudent\\nAnnual Income *\\nCredit Score\\nSelect Credit Score Range\\nExcellent (750+)\\nGood (700-749)\\nFair (650-699)\\nPoor (Below 650)\\nNot Sure\\nDown Payment\\nVehicle & Loan Information\\nVehicle of Interest\\nPreferred Loan Term\\nSelect Loan Term\\n24 months\\n36 months\\n48 months\\n60 months\\n72 months\\n84 months\\nAdditional Information\\nSUBMIT APPLICATION\\nBy submitting this form, you agree to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Service. We will use this information to process your financing application.\\nQuestions About Financing?\\nOur finance experts are here to help. Contact us today to discuss your financing options or get pre-approved over the phone.\\nCONTACT US\\nCALL (262)-249-6777\",\n \"contact\": \"CONTACT US\\nGet In Touch\\nWe're Here to Help You Find Your Dream Vehicle\\nWAYS TO REACH US\\nMultiple Ways to Connect\\nWhether you prefer to call, email, or visit us in person, we're here to assist you with all your automotive needs. Our team is ready to help you find the perfect vehicle.\\nPhone\\n(262)-249-6777\\nCall us during business hours\\nEmail\\nInfo@GenevaMotorHaus.com\\nSend us an email anytime\\nAddress\\n600 Faust RD Unit 8, Burlington WI, 53105\\nVisit our showroom\\nSEND US A MESSAGE\\nContact Form\\nFill out the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as possible. For immediate assistance, please call us at (262)-249-6777.\\nFull Name *\\nEmail Address *\\nPhone Number\\nSubject *\\nMessage *\\nSEND MESSAGE\\nVISIT OUR SHOWROOM\\nLocation & Hours\\nGeneva Motor Haus\\n600 Faust RD\\nUNIT 8\\nBurlington WI, 53105\\nShowroom: (262)-249-6777\\nEmail: Info@GenevaMotorHaus.com\\nBusiness Hours\\nMonday - Friday\\n10AM-4PM\\nSaturday\\nAppt Only\\nSunday\\nClosed\\nWe're closed on major holidays. Please call ahead to confirm hours during holiday seasons.\\nFOLLOW US\\nConnect With Us Online\\nStay updated with our latest inventory, special offers, and automotive news by following us on social media.\\nInstagram\\nYouTube\\nTikTok\\nFacebook\"\n}"